{
  "corpus_version": 1,
  "description": "Shared rejection corpus for SkyrimNet content-store path and manifest-identity rules (CONTENT_STORE_DESIGN.md §2, §4, §5 step 3). Consumed by this repo's Node test suite via .github/scripts/lib/content-rules.mjs, and intended to be ported verbatim to the C++ installer's validator so hub CI and the engine provably reject the same attacks. Rules are order-sensitive: 'reason' is the code the FIRST failing rule must produce. Accept cases must produce no issues at all.",
